{
  "uid": "receptionai-overview",
  "title": "ReceptionAi \u2014 Platform Overview",
  "tags": [
    "receptionai"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Voice session utilization (contract A7)",
      "description": "Ratio of receptionai_voice_active_sessions to receptionai_voice_session_capacity. This is the HPA signal per 05 E19.4 \u2014 voice workers sit at 15-25% CPU while completely full, so CPU never fires.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.85
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "receptionai:voice_session_utilization",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API request rate by status",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (http_status_code) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_count[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_status_code}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "API latency p50 / p95 / p99",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_duration_milliseconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tenant GUC violations (must stay 0)",
      "description": "Contract 2.4 / A3.5: every request sets app.tenant_id via SET LOCAL. RLS fails closed, so a miss looks like empty results rather than an error \u2014 it needs a counter to be visible at all.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(receptionai_tenant_guc_missing_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "last 1h"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "LLM traces \u2014 Langfuse",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Which agent ran, which tool fired, tokens and cost per turn\n\nPrometheus and Tempo answer *how slow* and *how many*. They do not carry prompts, completions, token counts or per-turn cost \u2014 05 \u00a7D14.5 forbids content on a span attribute, so the AI layer's detail lives in Langfuse instead.\n\n**Open Langfuse** at `http://localhost:$LANGFUSE_PORT` (`3110` by default; check `.env` \u2014 this stack may remap it) \u2014 traces are one per conversation turn, with a child span per graph node (`ai.node.*`), per model call (`llm.chat` / `llm.stream`) and per tool (`ai.tool.*`). Filter by `session_id` to see a whole conversation.\n\n_Prompt and completion text is **masked by default**. A tenant opts in via `tenant_settings` (namespace `observability`, key `tracing.capture`), bounded by `LANGFUSE_CAPTURE`._\n\n_Empty? Langfuse is optional \u2014 set `LANGFUSE_ENABLED=true` and the keys in `.env`, then restart the API._"
      }
    }
  ]
}
